      "zh": "雖然真的很害怕"
    },
    {
      "ja": "後悔はしたくない",
      "romaji": "Koukai ha Shitakunai",
      "en": "I don't want to have regrets",
      "zh": "但我不想後悔"
    },
    {
      "ja": "何回目の世界だっけ",
      "romaji": "Nankaime no Sekai Dakke",
